# Qt frontend C++ sources. These mark strings with Qt's tr() rather than _(),
# so the catalog regen must add --keyword=tr:1 for them (the Qt frontend routes
# tr() through the same gettext catalog via QtGettextTranslator). The Qt .ui
# files are not listed: uic emits their strings into generated ui_*.h, so they
# are extracted from the build tree, not from source.
